            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "First of all, is there a reason for using custom autocommand instead of default `MiniSessions.config.autowrite`? It does [almost exactly that](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee7c02297cf95cba07f8bf8da3ecf99337a1c15e/lua/mini/sessions.lua#L81).\r\n\r\nAnd yes, this might be due to some friction between 'mini.nvim' and 'nvim-notify' as most of user notifications are done with `vim.notify`. I'll look into this.",
